# Keep LF in the working tree on every platform.
#
# The Go toolchain and the container shell scripts run on Linux even when the
# development host is Windows: a CRLF checkout would make `gofmt -l` report
# every file as unformatted and would break `sh` here-documents.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary

# GitHub Linguist language overrides
# Mark embedded web portal assets as vendored so GitHub reflects Go (Golang) as the primary platform language
web/** linguist-vendored
control-plane/internal/portal/dist/** linguist-vendored
